  "recipeCuisine": "Italy",
  "name": "Buongustaio Sauce",
  "text": "Buongustaio Sauce\n\nPreparation time: 15 minutes\n\nCooking time: 22 minutes\n\nYield: 4\n\nIngredients\n\n1 tbsp olive oil,\n\n1 large onion, (finely chopped),\n\n2 cloves of garlic (finely chopped),\n\n1 aubergine (peeled and diced),\n\n125 g (4 oz) mushrooms (sliced),\n\n400 g (13 oz) can chopped tomatoes,\n\nsprig of sage,\n\nsalt and pepper.\n\nEquipment\n\n1 large saucepan\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Heat the oil in a saucepan.\n\n2. Add the onion, garlic and aubergine and cook for 5 minutes.\n\n3. Add the mushrooms and tomatoes, plus the juice from the can.\n\n4. Add the sage and a little salt and pepper.\n\n5. Bring to the boil, then reduce the heat.\n\n6. Cover the pan and cook gently for 15 minutes.\n\n7. Remove the sage before serving.",
  "prepTime": "PT15M",
  "cookTime": "PT22M",
